<title>CHILE: Laboratorio Chile reports higher 9-mo net.</title>
<headline>Laboratorio Chile reports higher 9-mo net.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean pharmaceuticals maker Laboratorio Chile reported the following results for the first nine months of 1996 against the same period of 1995.</p>
<p>				9-mo 1996		9-mo 1995</p>
<p>Net profit		    3.90			1.86</p>
<p>Operating profit	    4.68			2.96</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	  205 million	     894 million</p>
<p>Total revenues	     23.47		     19.44</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in billions of Chilean pesos except where noted.</p>
<p>-- Santiago newsroom +56-2-6995595 x211</p>
</text>
